### Create transfer
POST http://localhost:8081/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotencyKey": "idempotency-test-2",
  "fromAccountId": 100,
  "toAccountId": 200,
  "amount": 100.00,
  "description": "Idempotency test"
}

#### Get transfer by ID
GET http://localhost:8081/api/transfers/1

### Get all transfers
GET http://localhost:8081/api/transfers